	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"道具不要で簡単組み立てのポケモンプラモコレクション セレクトシリーズに「グレンアルマ」が登場！",
			"• 頭の炎は「インサート成形」でグラデーションを表現！",
			"• わざ「アーマーキャノン」を放つポーズを再現できる、左右の肩当ての差し替えパーツが付属！バトルシーンのかっこいいポーズを再現して遊ぼう！",
			"• 付属の台座を使用して、お気に入りのポーズで遊ぼう！"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"Glen Alma\" is now available in the Pokemon plastic model collection select series that requires no tools and is easy to assemble!",
			"• The flame on the head is \"insert molded\" to create a gradation!",
			"• Replacement parts for left and right shoulder rests are included to recreate the pose of firing the \"Armor Cannon\" move! Let's recreate cool poses from battle scenes!",
			"• Use the included pedestal to play with your favorite poses!"
		]
	},
